{"蛇":[["他一点也不怕蛇。","tā yì diǎn yě bú pà shé ","He's not at all afraid of snakes.","tatoeba:889637"],["“你喜欢蛇吗？”“当然不喜欢。”"," nǐ xǐ huan shé ma    dāng rán bù xǐ huan  ","\"Do you like snakes?\" \"Of course not.\"","tatoeba:399896"],["蛇年开始了。","shé nián kāi shǐ le ","The year of the snake has begun.","tatoeba:3377935"]],"猴":[["这是猴肉。","zhè shì hóu ròu ","It's monkey meat.","tatoeba:13549540"],["山上发现了不少猴子。","shān shàng fā xiàn le bù shǎo hóu zi ","Not a few monkeys were found in the mountain.","tatoeba:343257"],["你看着像猴。","nǐ kàn zhe xiàng hóu ","You look like a monkey.","tatoeba:5780564"]],"鼠":[["猫吃了老鼠。","māo chī le lǎo shǔ ","The cat ate the rat.","tatoeba:2333759"],["黑猫在吃白鼠。","hēi māo zài chī bái shǔ ","The black cat is eating the white mouse.","tatoeba:1888699"],["要不要买个无线鼠标呢？","yào bu yào mǎi gè wú xiàn shǔ biāo ne ","Should I buy a wireless mouse?","tatoeba:10041929"]],"树":[["树在哪里？","shù zài nǎ lǐ ","Where is the tree?","tatoeba:4761858"],["这些树很美。","zhè xiē shù hěn měi ","These trees are beautiful.","tatoeba:10752905"],["乡间有很多树。","xiāng jiān yǒu hěn duō shù ","The countryside has many trees.","tatoeba:332921"]],"叶":[["这是一种再加工茶叶。","zhè shì yì zhǒng zài jiā gōng chá yè ","This is a type of reprocessed tea.","tatoeba:5977439"],["树叶变黄了。","shù yè biàn huáng le ","The leaves have turned yellow.","tatoeba:1323412"],["这些绿叶到秋天变成红色或黄色。","zhè xiē lǜ yè dào qiū tiān biàn chéng hóng sè huò huáng sè ","These green leaves turn red or yellow in fall.","tatoeba:392236"]],"大":[["我家很大。","wǒ jiā hěn dà ","My house is big.","tatoeba:336235"],["他多大了？","tā duō dà le ","How old is he?","tatoeba:454259"],["大家好吗？","dà jiā hǎo ma ","How's everyone?","tatoeba:819309"]],"小":[["走路小心。","zǒu lù xiǎo xīn ","Watch your step.","tatoeba:826192"],["这本书小。","zhè běn shū xiǎo ","This book is small.","tatoeba:5869913"],["我是小雨。","wǒ shì xiǎo yǔ ","I am Xiaoyu.","tatoeba:6142021"]],"高":[["你有多高？","nǐ yǒu duō gāo ","How tall are you?","tatoeba:393593"],["他没你高。","tā méi nǐ gāo ","He's not as tall as you are.","tatoeba:877661"],["我个子高。","wǒ gè zi gāo ","I'm tall.","tatoeba:7772132"]],"矮":[["我个头矮。","wǒ gè tóu ǎi ","I am short.","tatoeba:4265202"],["你没我矮。","nǐ méi wǒ ǎi ","You are not as short as I.","tatoeba:10272080"],["我太矮了。","wǒ tài ǎi le ","I am too short.","tatoeba:512866"]],"长":[["这有多长？","zhè yǒu duō cháng ","How long is this?","tatoeba:826260"],["说来话长。","shuō lái huà cháng ","It's a long story.","tatoeba:1565704"],["他是长子。","tā shì zhǎng zǐ ","He's the oldest son.","tatoeba:7768239"]],"短":[["短回答是是。","duǎn huí dá shì shì ","The short answer is yes.","tatoeba:9953376"],["我喜欢短发。","wǒ xǐ huan duǎn fà ","I like short hair.","tatoeba:414239"],["外语很多，时间很短","wài yǔ hěn duō  shí jiān hěn duǎn","So many languages, so little time...","tatoeba:4047395"]],"胖":[["你有点胖。","nǐ yǒu diǎn pàng ","You are a bit fat.","tatoeba:9932536"],["他胖起来了。","tā pàng qǐ lái le ","He has gotten fat.","tatoeba:4931168"],["这个女人很胖。","zhè ge nǚ rén hěn pàng ","The woman is fat.","tatoeba:2778823"]],"瘦":[["你瘦了吗？","nǐ shòu le ma ","Did you lose weight?","tatoeba:10314344"],["这个女人很瘦。","zhè ge nǚ rén hěn shòu ","This woman is very thin.","tatoeba:779509"],["他看来每天都在变瘦。","tā kàn lái měi tiān dōu zài biàn shòu ","He seemed to be getting thinner every day.","tatoeba:5624905"]],"坏":[["电脑坏了。","diàn nǎo huài le ","The computer is broken.","tatoeba:693742"],["他好坏不分。","tā hǎo huài bù fēn ","He doesn't know the difference between right and wrong.","tatoeba:1330048"],["你是个坏孩子。","nǐ shì gè huài hái zi ","You're a bad child.","tatoeba:1325102"]],"真":[["真他妈热。","zhēn tā mā rè ","It's fucking hot.","tatoeba:3586044"],["你真没用。","nǐ zhēn méi yòng ","You're really useless.","tatoeba:6065718"],["那个真好。","nà ge zhēn hǎo ","That one is really good.","tatoeba:6169153"]],"假":[["这是假发。","zhè shì jiǎ fà ","This is a wig.","tatoeba:5637367"],["她请了天假。","tā qǐng le tiān jiǎ ","She's taken a day off.","tatoeba:10518605"],["我这个星期放假了。","wǒ zhè ge xīng qī fàng jià le ","I'm on holiday this week.","tatoeba:359530"]],"美":[["他是美国人。","tā shì měi guó rén